WEBVTT

00:41:29.079 --> 00:41:33.829
And that's why I'm trying to create this
virtual Jane who actually reaches far

00:41:33.829 --> 00:41:34.829
more people.

00:41:35.288 --> 00:41:37.121
Well, I love virtual Jane.

00:41:37.496 --> 00:41:40.913
It certainly seems it seems more efficient
and convenient for you.

00:41:41.704 --> 00:41:45.204
But I do I do hope you can get back
out in nature in the near future.

00:41:45.704 --> 00:41:48.163
Jane, it's been such an honor
to speak with you.

00:41:48.496 --> 00:41:52.038
You've done so much for humanity,
for animals, for the planet.

00:41:53.496 --> 00:41:56.246
Are just really grateful that you're
willing to take the time to do this.

00:41:56.246 --> 00:41:57.329
So thank you so much.

00:41:58.163 --> 00:42:04.246
Well, thank you to I think everybody
listening should remember that every